# Files in this repository that are NOT part of the website.
#
# Everything at the root is uploaded and served by address, so without
# this list the worker's own source, the database scripts and the setup
# notes would all be downloadable from the site. None of them hold a
# secret - the only keys in this repository are the publishable ones -
# but they are not pages, so they should not be served as pages.

worker.js
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore

# database scripts, run by hand in Supabase
*.sql
supabase/

# notes for whoever maintains this
README.md
SETUP.md

# working files
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json
